WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.084 --> 00:00:04.071
(gusty wind)

00:00:04.918 --> 00:00:07.119
(gentle piano music)

00:00:07.119 --> 00:00:09.026
(knocking)

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.546
- Sorry I'm late, I went
down a few different alleys

00:00:12.546 --> 00:00:14.293
before I found this one.

00:00:14.293 --> 00:00:16.241
Had to run from some dogs.

00:00:16.241 --> 00:00:17.971
- There are a lot of alleys
in this neighborhood.

00:00:17.971 --> 00:00:19.121
And feral animals.

00:00:19.121 --> 00:00:21.003
- And nondescript white vans, actually.

00:00:21.003 --> 00:00:22.800
- [Man] Down the way,
- [Woman] Drug deals, one sec.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.783
- [Radio] We have a
rolling calender, here.

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:24.626
(indistinct radio chatter)

00:00:24.626 --> 00:00:25.787
- [Radio] I don't have time for this!

00:00:25.787 --> 00:00:27.300
- False alarm, they're just listing off

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.342
random dates and times.

00:00:28.342 --> 00:00:29.521
Get in here.

00:00:29.521 --> 00:00:30.985
(lively piano music)

00:00:30.985 --> 00:00:32.710
Thank you for being so flexible.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.162
There's all these drug dealers meeting,

00:00:34.162 --> 00:00:35.981
and a lot of coke, and
you know what it's like.

00:00:35.981 --> 00:00:38.889
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, totally, I just,

00:00:38.889 --> 00:00:43.410
I'm glad I'm here with you
for our one week anniversary.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.381
- Oh, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:47.289 --> 00:00:50.289
(energetic music)

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:58.073
- Am I triggering a memory?

00:00:58.073 --> 00:00:59.001
I have to stop making jokes.

00:00:59.001 --> 00:01:01.205
- Oh, I can fix this.

00:01:01.205 --> 00:01:03.138
We need something to make
this intimate and romantic,

00:01:03.138 --> 00:01:05.307
and not like I completely
forgot our anniversary.

00:01:05.307 --> 00:01:07.435
- No, no, no, this is actually

00:01:07.435 --> 00:01:10.604
a really cozy surveillance van.

00:01:11.511 --> 00:01:12.625
- Really?

00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:14.775
- Yeah, and, and, watching
you do the stakeout

00:01:14.775 --> 00:01:18.028
is actually kinda hot.

00:01:18.028 --> 00:01:19.237
- What?

00:01:19.898 --> 00:01:20.604
- Hot.

00:01:20.604 --> 00:01:22.723
- Max, use your words.

00:01:22.723 --> 00:01:24.034
- It's hot watching you work.

00:01:24.849 --> 00:01:28.630
- We need to keep a low profile.

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:30.791
But you're right.

00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:31.875
If I don't get these bad guys,

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:33.418
drugs are gonna flood the streets,

00:01:33.418 --> 00:01:36.087
and then millions of people will die.

00:01:36.087 --> 00:01:37.964
Wanna listen in?

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:38.882
- Can I?

00:01:38.882 --> 00:01:39.842
- Uh huh.

00:01:39.842 --> 00:01:40.801
- Yeah!

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.769
- Okay.

00:01:43.595 --> 00:01:46.875
(indistinct radio chatter)

00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:48.190
- [Radio] They're doing three, two,

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:49.768
- [Radio] My daughter does ballet lessons

00:01:49.768 --> 00:01:52.551
- [Radio] one,
- [Radio] and oh my god!

00:01:53.383 --> 00:01:54.898
- [Max] I get that, all I'm saying

00:01:54.898 --> 00:01:58.193
is Ken Oshiro needs to work
on his communication skills.

00:01:58.193 --> 00:01:59.903
- Well, Santella needs to
realize that Ken Oshiro

00:01:59.903 --> 00:02:02.239
is running an entire crime syndicate.

00:02:02.239 --> 00:02:04.449
- Yeah, but if Ken Oshiro
would just be open and honest

00:02:04.449 --> 00:02:06.952
about how many kilos
he can actually move--

00:02:06.952 --> 00:02:09.454
- I can't believe you're
on Santella's side.

00:02:09.454 --> 00:02:11.289
- What, no, of course I'm not,

00:02:11.289 --> 00:02:13.125
he cuts people's pinkies
off and eats them.

00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:14.709
- And Ken Oshiro collects human teeth.

00:02:14.709 --> 00:02:18.346
Who's to say who the better man is?

00:02:19.308 --> 00:02:21.738
- Oh, I'll, I can go get food.

00:02:21.738 --> 00:02:24.867
- You remembered our
anniversary, you've done enough.

00:02:24.867 --> 00:02:26.888
I got us covered.

00:02:26.888 --> 00:02:29.808
Write down everything they say.

00:02:29.808 --> 00:02:32.602
I'll be back in one second.

00:02:35.309 --> 00:02:37.574
- Wait, I.

00:02:42.863 --> 00:02:45.832
(playful music)

00:02:46.396 --> 00:02:47.698
- I love rice.

00:02:47.698 --> 00:02:48.692
- Me too.

00:02:48.692 --> 00:02:49.708
- I thought I was the only one

00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:51.147
who ordered plain white rice.

00:02:51.147 --> 00:02:52.556
- [Woman] Drug dealers, who knew?

00:02:52.556 --> 00:02:53.889
- [Max] It's because they have ulcers.

00:02:53.889 --> 00:02:55.584
- [Woman] I'm just really picky.

00:02:55.584 --> 00:02:57.544
Oh my god!

00:02:57.544 --> 00:03:00.255
- Is this the drug dealer's order?

00:03:00.255 --> 00:03:03.526
(dramatic music)

00:03:06.156 --> 00:03:07.220
(screaming)

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.764
- Where the fuck is my rice?

00:03:09.764 --> 00:03:11.474
(Max whimpers)

00:03:11.474 --> 00:03:13.226
- That's not loaded.

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:15.020
(gunshot)

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.430
- So it is.

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:17.636
- Arrest him now, please.

00:03:17.636 --> 00:03:19.005
- But I dropped my gun in the alley

00:03:19.005 --> 00:03:20.692
on the way to get the takeout food.

00:03:20.692 --> 00:03:22.898
We're completely unprotected.

00:03:22.898 --> 00:03:23.585
- Why?

00:03:23.585 --> 00:03:25.238
- What do you know about Ken Oshiro?

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:25.906
- Nothing.

00:03:25.906 --> 00:03:30.906
- Honestly, that Ken Oshiro is
not good enough for Santella.

00:03:33.602 --> 00:03:37.556
- No, Santella is completely
happy with Ken Oshiro.

00:03:37.556 --> 00:03:41.290
- He doesn't wanna deal drugs
with anybody but Ken Oshiro.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:42.866
- Hey, we gotta cancel the drop tonight,

00:03:42.866 --> 00:03:44.170
and torch a police van.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.464
- He doesn't?

00:03:45.464 --> 00:03:49.891
- No, he only wants to
deal drugs with you.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.766
- This is the best anniversary ever.

00:03:52.766 --> 00:03:54.476
- Same time, next week.

00:03:54.476 --> 00:03:56.937
Did you just say is was your anniversary?

00:03:56.937 --> 00:03:58.712
- Oh, one week.

00:03:58.712 --> 00:04:01.081
- Well I hope you two are read
to spend eternity together.

00:04:01.081 --> 00:04:02.984
- Oh, it's gonna hurt.

00:04:02.984 --> 00:04:04.569
- [Woman] It's gonna hurt a lot.

00:04:04.569 --> 00:04:06.696
- 'Cuz I want you crazy
kids to work it out.

00:04:06.696 --> 00:04:09.333
(playful music)

00:04:15.914 --> 00:04:17.289
(energetic music)

